Description: A fitted FINN forest model calibrated to the German National Forest Inventory (Bundeswaldinventur, BWI), packaged as a
    versioned simulation tool. Loads the released parameters, rebuilds the model
    with the installed FINN and simulates forest dynamics for new sites.
